        "consciousness_freq": 2.4686816209744467,
        "quantum_harmony": 1.131556868666315,
        "frequency_band": "theta",
        "phi_pairs": []
      },
      {
        "text": "\"'Tis some visitor,\" I muttered, \"tapping at my chamber door\u2014",
